#
# LeakSanitizer suppressions of the Saturday soak (AC-M4-03; 07 section 7.1 "Soak"; 08 section 6.10; D-213):
# the leak stacks of Qt, fontconfig and glib.
#
# LeakSanitizer drops a leak when ANY frame of its allocation stack matches a pattern below (a module, a function
# or a file, as a substring). A pattern that could also appear in the stack of an allocation Esses made (Qt's
# event loop, signal and timer delivery, QObject, widget and model code, glib's main-loop dispatch: they all call
# into Esses) would therefore hide an Esses leak, so the rule for this file is:
#   a pattern names code of Qt, fontconfig or glib that allocates for itself and never calls back into the
#   application: fontconfig as a module (it calls no one), glib's type, quark and interned-string tables (never
#   its main loop), and Qt's font database, font engines, platform plugin and plugin loader.
# tests/soak/lsan_check.py --self-test checks every line against that rule (the families and the refused
# patterns are listed there; ctest soak.lsan_check.self_test and the soak job run it). Leaks LeakSanitizer still
# prints are judged by lsan_check.py: one with an esses frame fails the soak; one without is a warning naming its
# library, to be added here under this rule after review.

# fontconfig: the whole module (its caches and patterns; it never calls out).
leak:libfontconfig.so

# glib: the type system, quarks and interned strings (process-lifetime tables, never the main loop).
leak:g_type_register_static
leak:g_type_register_fundamental
leak:g_type_add_interface_static
leak:g_type_class_ref
leak:g_quark_from_static_string
leak:g_quark_from_string
leak:g_intern_static_string
leak:g_intern_string

# Qt: the font database and its engines, the platform plugin and the plugin loader (one-time initialisation
# whose objects live until exit, never handed to the caller).
leak:QFontconfigDatabase::
leak:QFontDatabasePrivate::
leak:QFontEngineFT::
leak:QFreetypeFace::
leak:QOffscreenIntegration::
leak:QGuiApplicationPrivate::createPlatformIntegration
leak:QFactoryLoader::
leak:QLibraryPrivate::
